      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "olf_c6j_hmg",
      "source_quote": "家世貧窶，而躬耕好學。",
      "reading": "家貧而躬耕好學。",
      "note": "家貧而躬耕好學。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuhuaisu-received:p001",
